"{\"new_string\":\"## Integrity and reproducibility\\n\\n- Exact SHA-256 hashes of the source and manifest files (`index.js`, `package.json`, `README.md`) are recorded in `checksums.txt` (standard `sha256sum` format).\\n- Verify the inputs have not changed:\\n\\n  ```bash\\n  sha256sum -c checksums.txt\\n  ```\\n\\n- Regenerate `checksums.txt` after an intentional change:\\n\\n  ```bash\\n  npm run hash\\n  ```\\n\\n- Dependencies: none. Any dependency added in the future must be declared in `package.json` with an exact pinned version (no `^` or `~` ranges) so dependency inputs stay reproducible.\\n\\n## License\\n\\nMIT\",\"old_string\":\"## License\\n\\nMIT\",\"path\":\"README.md\"}"